  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Monster Hunter: World - Iceborne Master Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/16981/450x258/monster-hunter-world-iceborne-master-edition-master-edition-pc-game-steam-europe-cover.jpg?v=1794927600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/16981-buy-monster-hunter-world-iceborne-master-edition-master-edition-pc-game-steam-europe/",
      "user": "gamer-761223a",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Monster Hunter to jedna z najbardziej znanych marek Capcom jak i w ogóle gier. Tutaj mamy ogrom zadań i potworów, dużo farmienia. Gra wraz z dodatkiem na luzie starcza na ponad 100 godzin. Oczywiście produkcję można również rushowac aby poznać fabułę i mieć spokój. Każdy znajdzie tu coś dla siebie. Polecam do ogrania samemu jak i w drużynie."
    },
    {
      "game": "Onimusha: Way of the Sword",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/7913/450x258/onimusha-way-of-the-sword-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1794927600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/7913-buy-onimusha-way-of-the-sword-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-4f6ba2",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "As a non-souls like gamer. This was actually pretty good. I got frustrated on some ocasions but the easy mode made it possible for me to enjoy more the story. The combat itself is also satisfying and I played like 25h in 3 days so... it speaks for itself. The atmosphere, graphics, charracters and the voice acting are all top noch. They bring this game to life so to say. I would recomand this game to anyone that enjoyed the God of War games or Ghost of tsushima."
    },
    {
      "game": "Hell is Us",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/10768/450x258/hell-is-us-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1794927600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/10768-buy-hell-is-us-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Sakanaki",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "\"soulslike\" combat but on the easier side. The setting a a civil war with to much... deep information about such things. It is gruesome ... The gameplay itself is a search / puzzle / fighting game which is really good. If you can block the setting in your head it is a good one :)"
    },
    {
      "game": "Need For Speed: Rivals",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/11682/450x258/need-for-speed-rivals-xbox-one-microsoft-store-cover.jpg?v=1794927600",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/11682-buy-need-for-speed-rivals-xbox-one-microsoft-store/",
      "user": "gamer-468c895",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "This takes me back to OG consoles and original nfs titles. The remakes are okay but rivals adds an edge that improves gameplay. Now I do want to mention that multi-player is no longer active however, inpersonally love it for the story mode."
